    "row_labels": [
     "(1) Royalty on Receipts (as at present) — 5 per cent. on receipts of railless cars for 1920, viz., $71,436—$3,572 ÷ 7 cars",
     "(2) Profit to Council on sale of electricity for Traction (as at present) — 3 per cent. per annum on gross capital for traction power plant (in addition to interest and depreciation) Tls. 6,843 ÷ 182 cars = Tls. 38 at 72",
     "(3) Reconstruction Contributions requested by Council —",
     "(a) Roads estimated (on information from the Commissioner of Public Works) at $1,574,050 of which one-half is —",
     "(b) Bridges — 3 at Tls. 180,000 = Tls. 540,000 of which 25 per cent. is Tls. 135,000 at 72",
     "[Unlabelled sub-total of (3)(a) and (3)(b), printed under the two figures]",
     "Interest at 7 per cent. on = $68,217 ÷ 110 cars",
     "(4) Road Maintenance Charge requested by Council — ½ tael cent per railless car mile = 0.7 dollar cent by 30,000 car miles per car per annum",
     "[Unlabelled total, printed under the last figure]"
